e error decomposition (design term well predicted, floor 2.5x the model's prediction, cause not identified), the synthetic and misspecification ladder, and the scope sweeps. Figures 1-4 and Tables 1-2 come from `figtab`; the checklist is in place.\n\nWhat it does not yet hold, and the paper makes no statement about: the inference-rule comparison table (P2-P6), adaptive selection against batch on data, the greedy-versus-exhaustive check, and the second (LLM) matrix. These wait for result files from `experiment-repo`; the text will gain them when they exist. The numbers are written from the `ct_*` files at experiment-repo 22951e7; the owner's confirmation of what each result is stands open in experiment-repo#6.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n{\n  \"name\": \"README.md\",\n  \"path\": \"code/README.md\",\n  \"sha\": \"7228f8b90369102a058fccd989428a2dbfaec799\",\n  \"last_commit_sha\": \"b24c49951c2f503ff1c11174e1385d00c04e68e2\",\n  \"last_commit_when\": \"2026-11-26T23:19:59Z\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"size\": 8296,\n  \"encoding\": \"base64\",\n  \"content\": \"IyBDb2RlOiB\n```", "exit": null}}}, {"id": "23700a78-65a3-5d7b-b255-900e0877995c", "at": 1795735329.3395154, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 49507, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "3d988e784fe81628f6b436144ed8ad7e", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "0c6ac525-d649-5c91-b0d2-7f920072b827", "at": 1795735329.398123, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 49513, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.session/request_permission", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "3d988e784fe81628f6b436144ed8ad7e", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes"